## fsharp

<!-- livebook:{"break_markdown":true} -->

### atan2

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl atan2 (y : f64) (x : f64) : f64 =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () =>\n            global \"import gleam_community/maths\"\n            $'maths.atan2(!y, !x)' : float\n        Lua = fun () => $'math.atan2(!y, !x)' : float\n        Fsharp = fun () => $'System.Math.Atan2 (!y, !x)' : float\n        Python = fun () => \n            global \"import math\"\n            $'math.atan2(!y, !x)' : float\n        Rust = fun () => $'(!y).atan2(!x)' : float\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl atan2 (y : f64) (x : f64) : f64 =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () =>
              global "import gleam_community/maths"
              $'maths.atan2(!y, !x)' : float
          Lua = fun () => $'math.atan2(!y, !x)' : float
          Fsharp = fun () => $'System.Math.Atan2 (!y, !x)' : float
          Python = fun () => 
              global "import math"
              $'math.atan2(!y, !x)' : float
          Rust = fun () => $'(!y).atan2(!x)' : float
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> gleam -d gleam_community_maths=\\\">=2.0.0\\\"\n///> lua\n///> fsharp\n///> cuda\n\n0 |> atan2 1\n|> _assert_eq 1.5707963267948966","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> gleam -d gleam_community_maths=\">=2.0.0\"
  ///> lua
  ///> fsharp
  ///> cuda

  0 |> atan2 1
  |> _assert_eq 1.5707963267948966
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

